  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#image-sources-for-2d-rendering-contexts\r\n\r\n> If image's readyState attribute is either HAVE\\_NOTHING or HAVE\\_METADATA, then return bad\\.\r\n\r\nIf the video element is playing only audio, the readyState can be HAVE_ENOUGH_DATA but no image is available, yet the DrawImage algorithm seems to assume that an image indeed is available.",
